  "details": "# Issue:\n\nIn the Audio Tab of the Quick Menu there is a button at the top right which is supposed to bring you to the Main Menu Settings for more options. This currently only brings you to the last Settings Category you had open in it and not directly to the Audio Category.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nThe button should always bring you to the Main Menu Audio Settings.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://files.catbox.moe/9bu39e.mp4",
